<title>UK: Signet says like for like sales up 6.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Signet says like for like sales up 6.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Signet Group Plc, owner of the Ernest Jones and H. Samuel jewellery chains, said on Monday that group like-for-like sales were up 6.6 percent in the 23 week to July 12.</p>
</text>
